WEBVTT

00:13.041 --> 00:15.541
Leave Chinatown to follow me
and you shall live.

00:15.583 --> 00:17.458
Otherwise, you shall die.

00:20.041 --> 00:22.708
Since the bloody battle at Chinatown,

00:23.041 --> 00:24.291
security has been tightened.

00:24.333 --> 00:26.541
The eradication of rogues
has been accelerated.

00:26.625 --> 00:29.291
The era of territorial rivalry is over.

00:30.583 --> 00:32.875
Long, Phong, Ba

00:33.208 --> 00:36.208
withdrew from the criminal world
according to the wish of Hung Chinatown.

00:36.416 --> 00:39.333
The gangland at that time was a calm lake.

00:40.041 --> 00:42.750
Until someone tries to stir it up.

00:52.625 --> 00:55.250
The blood debt must be paid with blood.

00:56.958 --> 01:00.666
A storm coming from The North Port
stirs Chinatown once more.

02:04.333 --> 02:05.500
Nobody move!

02:43.416 --> 02:45.708
[HUNG LONG PHONG BA]
Bang! All are under siege!

02:45.750 --> 02:47.333
Silent! Take a seat!

02:47.416 --> 02:48.666
Gosh, he's demented.

02:49.458 --> 02:50.958
What an asshole.

02:51.458 --> 02:53.250
Brotherhood my ass.

02:53.333 --> 02:56.166
It's a blessing that he's alive.
Do you really want him dead?

02:56.875 --> 02:58.833
- Is there anything you're hiding from me?
- No.

02:59.166 --> 03:02.041
Hey, you! Focus on writing your statement!

03:04.583 --> 03:05.833
Sir,

03:05.875 --> 03:07.291
my brothers made a mess.

03:07.333 --> 03:09.208
I just came to intervene.

03:09.416 --> 03:11.250
I didn't expect it would ignite a fire.

03:11.333 --> 03:12.916
My apologise.

03:13.041 --> 03:14.416
for having bothered you so much.

03:14.458 --> 03:16.125
Just write down.

04:18.708 --> 04:20.000
Long.

04:20.041 --> 04:21.708
Say something, Long.

04:28.416 --> 04:31.166
What kept you so busy that
you didn't bother contacting us?

04:32.125 --> 04:33.416
Huh?

04:38.291 --> 04:40.041
Do you consider us your brothers?

04:41.958 --> 04:44.166
The time we thought you were dead,

04:46.166 --> 04:47.583
we had also been dead inside.

04:49.333 --> 04:50.666
What an asshole.

04:51.333 --> 04:52.708
Long!

04:53.125 --> 04:56.166
Oh God, he's crying, guys.

04:56.666 --> 04:57.916
Let go of me.

04:58.041 --> 05:00.041
- You're impossible.
- Let go!

05:05.458 --> 05:06.833
Brotherhood my ass.

05:09.791 --> 05:11.166
Why didn't you contact us?

05:14.625 --> 05:15.875
This is my own business.

05:16.666 --> 05:18.041
It's not Chinatown here.

05:18.958 --> 05:21.041
It's also not a place to
show off your kungfu.

05:21.416 --> 05:23.041
It's a matter of life and death.

05:25.291 --> 05:27.125
This fight is not yours to take.

05:29.250 --> 05:30.458
Listen to me.

05:31.208 --> 05:33.125
Big brother is going back to
Chinatown tomorrow.

05:34.375 --> 05:35.833
You should tag along.

05:38.916 --> 05:40.250
I have things to do here.

05:40.416 --> 05:41.708
I cannot go back now.

05:44.666 --> 05:46.458
Dung has been held captive by Hac Hung.

05:50.750 --> 05:52.166
And I…

05:55.000 --> 05:56.583
I don't want to have regrets like you

06:01.875 --> 06:03.416
You guys should go back tomorrow.

06:04.166 --> 06:06.375
- I'll come back when everything's done.
- What?

06:08.500 --> 06:09.958
We will go together,

06:10.833 --> 06:12.250
and will perish together.

06:12.791 --> 06:14.416
This is my own problem.

06:15.041 --> 06:16.750
I'll follow him.

06:18.041 --> 06:19.666
You assholes.

06:27.291 --> 06:30.666
I thought you were a reasonable man.

06:34.958 --> 06:36.625
Do you have children?

06:38.041 --> 06:39.958
But you cannot act on your own.

06:41.041 --> 06:42.458
You don't know that feeling.

06:44.250 --> 06:46.416
Let a few juniors bear
the responsibility for you.

06:47.708 --> 06:49.541
You're being taken to Chinatown now.

06:50.625 --> 06:52.041
So don't be impulsive.

06:52.583 --> 06:55.708
We keep an eye on everything you do.

06:56.125 --> 06:59.625
I haven't arrested you yet
because you haven't crossed the line.

07:01.166 --> 07:03.250
And because I believe you're a good man.

07:06.125 --> 07:07.500
Thanks.

07:08.041 --> 07:10.708
You know we have the same goal.

07:11.916 --> 07:13.625
We just have different ways of doing it.

07:35.625 --> 07:37.416
I'm sorry for having bothered you.

07:38.958 --> 07:40.333
Don't say that.

07:41.625 --> 07:43.791
I still feel guilty for not
being able to help you.

07:44.625 --> 07:47.416
If Ky makes any move,

07:47.916 --> 07:49.333
I will let you know.

07:50.333 --> 07:51.666
Thank you.

07:59.541 --> 08:01.291
We'll be back when we're finished.

08:06.666 --> 08:08.000
Big brother?

08:08.833 --> 08:10.375
Give me back later.

08:26.916 --> 08:28.583
Tell me if it hurts.

08:38.541 --> 08:40.250
Shall I give you a barefoot massage?

10:31.708 --> 10:33.041
Nobody move!

10:40.458 --> 10:42.875
Who does that guy usually pick?

10:44.000 --> 10:45.250
Oh, Number 7.

10:45.291 --> 10:46.541
Then I'll pick Number 7.

10:46.541 --> 10:49.583
The civil defense force, working
with the police department

10:49.625 --> 10:52.333
to look into drug-related offences,

10:52.375 --> 10:54.416
recently busted criminals involved
in illegal drug trafficking.

10:54.416 --> 10:57.750
Synthetic drugs and related materials
have been seized.

10:57.875 --> 11:02.416
This is an interprovincial and
transnational drug trafficking ring

11:02.458 --> 11:04.666
constructed by a gang
of criminals into a tight line

11:04.708 --> 11:07.958
to transport narcotics from
Laos to Vietnam for consumption by road.

11:08.166 --> 11:10.625
At the moment,
the project committee is continuing

11:10.666 --> 11:12.625
to drastically direct
the project's expansion...

11:16.875 --> 11:18.125
I'm listening.

11:18.375 --> 11:19.625
Chinatown gang has teamed up with the cops

11:19.791 --> 11:21.041
and destroyed all of our goods.

11:21.333 --> 11:22.541
What did you say?

11:22.750 --> 11:24.000
We're hiding from them.
I'm hanging up here.

11:53.875 --> 11:55.166
Ky!

11:55.166 --> 11:56.416
What?

11:57.916 --> 11:59.791
I saw the police man on the train last time

12:00.458 --> 12:01.958
at Kim's place.

12:11.708 --> 12:13.333
Find me that mouse at all cost.

12:19.666 --> 12:20.750
Long.

12:20.791 --> 12:22.583
Tell me which one. I'll beat him.

12:22.625 --> 12:24.250
Hey, is it the one wearing jeans?

12:24.500 --> 12:25.875
No, he isn't.

12:26.875 --> 12:28.416
Is it the girl who just came out? Beat her!

12:28.416 --> 12:30.041
Are you crazy?

12:30.041 --> 12:31.833
So noisy. I'll tell you when I spot him.

12:37.291 --> 12:38.375
Hey, it's him. It's him.

12:38.416 --> 12:39.583
Beat him!

12:50.416 --> 12:51.750
Hi, man.

12:54.541 --> 12:55.875
Fuck you.

12:57.458 --> 12:58.916
Bastards! Do you know who I am?

12:59.041 --> 13:00.333
Who are you?

13:00.416 --> 13:02.041
I'm under Ky's command.

13:06.958 --> 13:08.208
Son of a bitch!

13:09.500 --> 13:10.791
Step aside, Ba!

13:10.833 --> 13:12.833
My goodness, Long!
Why did you call my name?

13:13.000 --> 13:16.250
- Phong, beat him harder.
- Why the hell did you call my name?

13:18.125 --> 13:19.375
So?

13:19.708 --> 13:21.958
Do you know who we are now?

13:23.125 --> 13:24.750
Yes, I do.

13:25.250 --> 13:27.500
Hac Hung is at Ky's place, isn't he?

13:28.708 --> 13:30.125
Yes.

13:30.750 --> 13:32.291
Where is that place?

13:33.833 --> 13:36.625
Answer quickly or he'll beat you.

13:40.458 --> 13:42.291
He's at the public port.

13:44.791 --> 13:46.166
That's all I know.

13:46.208 --> 13:47.458
Please spare my life.

13:47.541 --> 13:49.166
Alright, spare him.

13:49.833 --> 13:50.958
Go.

14:08.541 --> 14:09.916
Mai.

14:10.041 --> 14:12.208
Why didn't you turn on the light
after coming home?

14:45.125 --> 14:46.833
Is the light bulb broken?

14:53.666 --> 14:55.250
Let me go buy a new one.

15:30.250 --> 15:31.750
Run, Mai! Run!

15:33.583 --> 15:34.916
Dao!

15:55.250 --> 15:57.750
- Where is Number 7?
- Oh, I am Number 7.

16:02.708 --> 16:04.541
Wait? Sir?

17:25.416 --> 17:26.458
You bitch.

17:27.500 --> 17:28.708
Are you mute?

17:41.333 --> 17:43.041
Let go of me! Let go of me!

18:01.833 --> 18:03.791
I don't have time to play with you.

18:03.916 --> 18:05.458
Who are you reporting to?

18:08.541 --> 18:12.041
I have no idea what you're talking about.

18:16.541 --> 18:18.000
You have three seconds.

18:40.791 --> 18:42.291
You're laughing?

19:18.208 --> 19:19.583
I know who you are.

19:32.208 --> 19:33.750
I'll leave her to you guys.

19:35.375 --> 19:36.791
Do whatever you want,

19:38.166 --> 19:39.500
but she must be alive.

19:40.125 --> 19:42.208
I still have things to do with her.

19:45.458 --> 19:46.875
Keep laughing.

19:59.166 --> 20:00.500
Let me go!

20:54.125 --> 20:55.458
What the hell did you do, Ba?

20:55.500 --> 20:57.208
I imitated those self-defense videos.

20:57.250 --> 20:58.625
Stop watching those videos.

20:58.666 --> 20:59.833
You two are being noisy.

20:59.875 --> 21:01.666
Life is nothing like movies.

24:11.458 --> 24:12.958
I hear something.

24:13.166 --> 24:15.541
What are you listening to?
You don't have an ear on that side.

24:15.583 --> 24:16.875
I hear someone's breathing.

24:17.125 --> 24:19.500
No. It sounds like someone's having sex.

24:27.100 --> 24:29.252
Hey, Long! Long!

24:35.916 --> 24:37.326
You son of a bitch!

24:51.250 --> 24:52.541
Dung.

24:56.041 --> 24:57.791
I'm sorry. I'm late.

25:00.291 --> 25:01.583
How are you?

25:01.708 --> 25:05.041
Dung? Open your eyes and look at me.

25:05.041 --> 25:06.458
Dung, it's me.

25:08.166 --> 25:10.291
My Monk!

25:12.041 --> 25:13.958
It's me. It's me. Don't be scared.

25:14.041 --> 25:15.375
I'm here now.

25:42.333 --> 25:44.625
It's crowded out here, Long.

25:45.333 --> 25:46.750
Long!

25:46.791 --> 25:48.541
You handle the front, I'll handle the back.

26:07.041 --> 26:08.333
Long!

27:22.708 --> 27:23.750
Nam.

27:23.791 --> 27:26.041
The police have raided my bus station.

27:26.250 --> 27:27.583
I'm also hiding.

27:27.625 --> 27:29.041
Son of a bitch.

27:29.458 --> 27:31.291
I haven't even said anything.

27:31.375 --> 27:33.708
Every man for himself. Gotta go!

27:47.333 --> 27:48.583
Mr. Sau…

27:48.666 --> 27:50.541
I told you to never call me first.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.791
I'm out of plans.

27:53.718 --> 27:55.426
I have always been obeying you.

27:55.708 --> 27:56.916
You have to save me this time.

27:56.958 --> 27:59.208
You've screwed up everything.

27:59.458 --> 28:00.958
Just flee to Cambodia.

28:00.983 --> 28:02.983
Someone will pick you up at the border.

28:03.458 --> 28:04.833
But first,

28:05.367 --> 28:06.992
clean up your place.

28:08.375 --> 28:10.619
One more thing, about Hai Cuong,

28:10.644 --> 28:12.406
you know what to do.

28:57.500 --> 28:58.708
Long!

29:00.166 --> 29:01.208
Long!

29:01.291 --> 29:02.958
Hac Hung!

29:08.475 --> 29:10.417
Take cover!

29:52.875 --> 29:54.416
Ba, what's the matter with you?

29:54.916 --> 29:56.458
Damn, you got shot

29:56.583 --> 29:58.000
I'm cold, Phong.

29:58.708 --> 30:00.000
Hold on.

30:00.083 --> 30:01.583
Your wife and baby are waiting at home.

30:01.916 --> 30:03.583
Take me to the hospital.

30:03.708 --> 30:05.625
I can't bear it anymore.

30:09.000 --> 30:10.208
Hold on.

30:10.500 --> 30:11.833
Go, quick…

30:54.500 --> 30:55.875
Ba!
